# Phased Development

- Implement strictly in order: phase-00 → phase-06
- Before coding, read the current phase `README.md` (goal, DoD, checklist)
- Phase 3: temporarily set `startDestination = game/debug`
- Phase 4: restore `startDestination = login`; wire `LocalGameClient`
- Do not start Phase 5 until Phase 4 DoD is met
- Wireframes and nav diagrams: `docs/architecture/navigation-and-screens.md`
- Mark phase checklist items as done when completing tasks
- Each phase includes unit tests; see `docs/architecture/testing.md`
- `./gradlew testDebugUnitTest` must pass before moving to next phase
